<p id=Extract>Jenny's been wanting to visit this national park since we arrived,
but today was our first chance to do so. On the way there, we also
took a half hour to look at a house for sale.</p>

<!-- ### Add-A-Page ### 6/22/2022 3:54:36 PM ### -->
<figure>
	<figuretitle>Looking At A House</figuretitle>
	<p>One of the reasons for the trip to Costa Rica was for Jenny to look
at real estate. She told the real estate agent her requirements:
Number of rooms, relatively isolated, and near a beach. This was the
house he took us to see.</p>
	<img src="20220520_100000.jpg" />
</figure>

<figure>
	<p>It's certainly a lovely place.</p>
