<figure>
	<p><i>Pura Vida</i> (pure life) is Costa Rica's motto; people here say
it more often than Hawaiians say &quot;Aloha!&quot;. They use it to
say hello, goodbye, and in place of &quot;Okay&quot;. It looks like
someone designing tourist shirts got sick of it.</p>
	<img src="20220520_140820.jpg" />
</figure>

<figure>
	<p>And so, back at our suite, I checked my phone's step counter. Not bad
for a guy who's essentially crippled with bad Achilles tendons!</p>
